<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Suncrush lifts interim headline shr, div.</title>
<headline>Suncrush lifts interim headline shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		 38.2	 vs    36.2</p>
<p>    - attrib		   38.2	 vs    62.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		   4.5	 vs    5.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   60.16	 vs    92.27</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   77.91	 vs    133.46</p>
<p>    Tax			 21.81	 vs    22.76</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    4.67	 vs    0.11 gain</p>
<p>    Turnover		 458.20	 vs    402.46</p>
<p>    Share of associates'   4.90	 vs    1.85</p>
<p>Div payable March 21</p>
<p>on register March 7</p>
<p>Full name: Suncrush Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said capital expenditure on coolers, ice plants and vending equipment in the emerging market would gather momentum during calender year 1997 and would be substantial in the coming financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
